abstract: >
  An open-source collection of connected Markdown learning materials that trace
  how observations become scientific concepts, mechanisms, mathematical models,
  engineered components, and technological systems, including their limitations
  and trade-offs. Code and scripts are licensed under Apache-2.0; educational
  content is licensed under CC BY 4.0.
